Task: Show dropdown for coordinator based on parent church members

Summary:
- Integrated react-query useQuery inside OrganizacaoFormModal.tsx to fetch church members/participants using getOrganizacaoMembros(churchId) dynamically.
- Replaced the Coordinator and Vice-Coordinator text inputs in the modal with Select dropdown components containing the list of fetched church members (value is the member's name as string).
- Kept standard text input fields as fallback if the parent organization does not resolve to a church.
- Wrapped tests in OrganizacaoFormModal.test.tsx with QueryClientProvider and added assertions validating the members dropdown rendering.
